    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "George Voinovich built a public career across the Ohio House, Cuyahoga County, the lieutenant governor's office, Cleveland City Hall, the governor's office, and the United States Senate. Known for public-sector reform and urban recovery work, he helped lead Cleveland after fiscal crisis and carried Serbian and Slovenian heritage into civic and international affairs."
    ]
